{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國女神高允貞目前正拍攝韓劇《Moving：超異能族》第2季，她近日為代言品牌亮相時尚雜誌，分享接拍第2季的感想：「我不想讓任何人失望，因為我知道即使第1季很成功，續集的策劃和製作過程也絕非易事，開拍前，我曾擔心自己無法清晰地詮釋熙秀這個角</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T03:04:50.264617+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T02:39:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T02:58:44.808175+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T02:58:44.808175+00:00","content_hash":"970bf30c58542215d110484581841c61dedaa5a03f101ffb61a19eadc2662e63","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}